From: Guix channel maintainers
Subject: Keep immutable data independent of saves and editor output

Resolve source data relative to the installed modules, not the current working
directory.  The launcher owns the writable XDG working directory.  Make the
existing Tk application importable by the package's live GUI smoke driver.

--- a/ighalsk.py
+++ b/ighalsk.py
@@ -19,8 +19,11 @@
